# AI Game Manager Panel GitHub Safety Baseline - 0.1.85
# 原则：仓库只提交源码、公开配置模板、文档和许可证公钥；任何本机状态、密钥、授权材料、账号数据与构建产物不得进入 Git。

# Go / build outputs
/bin/
*.exe
*.test
/build/

# Frontend / Electron generated dependencies and outputs
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/package.json.md5
desktop/electron/node_modules/
desktop/electron/dist/
.pnpm-store/
**/.pnpm-store/

# Editors / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Environment / local overrides
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.local
*.local.json
configs/local/
configs/*.local.json

# AI Game Manager Panel runtime data: source repo keeps runtime/README.md only.
runtime/*
!runtime/README.md

# Legacy 0.1.64 and earlier runtime paths: never commit local user/server state.
data/
log/
logs/
backups/
instances/
temp/
exports/
plugins/
cache/

# License / CDK / cryptographic private material
# Public verification key must be embedded as source code or an explicitly reviewed *.pub file; generated *.key files stay local.
*.key
*.priv
*.seed
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.cdk
*.lic
*.license
*.bflc
**/activation.json
**/install.id
**/device.id
**/license-private.*
**/agmp-license-private.*
**/agmp-release-private.*
**/ReleaseKeys/
**/release-keys/
# legacy secret filename from pre-rebrand versions
**/bonfire-license-private.*

# Authentication / local administrator state
**/accounts.json
**/bootstrap.lock
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json
**/*security-key*.txt
**/*Security-Key*.txt

# Game server secrets / user-generated server state
**/cluster_token.txt
**/server_token.txt
**/adminlist.txt
**/whitelist.txt
**/blocklist.txt

# Local diagnostic / crash / package artifacts
*.log
*.dmp
*.stackdump
*.tmp
*.bak
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar

# Rust Agent Runtime build outputs
rust/target/
